{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2022-12-06 08:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE EXCEEDS NATIONAL AVERAGE FOR PATIENT SAFETY GRADES', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE:HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 81% OF ITS FACILITIES EARNED AN “A” OR “B” IN THE FALL 2022 LEAPFROG HOSPITAL SAFETY GRADE. THIS IS 24 PERCENTAGE POINTS HIGHER THAN THE NATIONAL AVERAGE OF 57%."}